---
metadata: {
  partial_name: "Subscribe"
}
---

{%- comment -%}
    This is a partial for the tracking of package, with javascript function to trigger
    the event with the button click or on key press enter(keyCode == 13).
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="subscribe">
    <div class="grid-container">
        <div class="grid-x grid-padding-x">
            <div class="large-12 medium-12 small-12">
                <div class="spacer xxxx-large"></div>
                <h2 class="centered">Stay up to date with Insites</h2>
                <div class="spacer small"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="large-12 medium-12 small-12">
                <p class="centered">Subscribe to our newsletter for the latest news and product updates straight to your inbox.</p>
                <div class="spacer large"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="large-7 medium-7 small-12 large-offset-2 medium-offset-1 cell">
                <ins-input
                    id="subscribe-input"
                    placeholder="Enter your Email Address"
                    field="text"
                    error-message="Please provide a valid Email Address.">
                </ins-input>
            </div>
            
            <div class="large-3 medium-4 small-12 cell">
                <ins-button
                    id="subscribe-button"
                    label="Subscribe"
                    size="large"
                    solid
                    color="blue"
                    size="normal">
                </ins-button>
                <div class="spacer xxxx-large"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
